# Copy to .env and fill in only the keys you actually use.
# .env is gitignored. Never commit real keys, and never paste one into a
# tracked file, a commit message, or a data/ file.
#
# You do not need any of these to start. Every agent works from plain files
# until you connect a real tool — and no agent may claim a tool is connected
# unless you have actually set it up.

# --- CRM (Sales) --------------------------------------------------------
# Use a read-only key if the provider offers one.
# HUBSPOT_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# --- Email (Sales, Marketing, Support) ----------------------------------
# Sending stays manual regardless of what's set here — agents draft only.
# GMAIL_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# GMAIL_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=

# --- Calendar (Operations) ----------------------------------------------
# GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID=

# --- Sheets / finance data (Finance) ------------------------------------
# Read-only. Never grant an agent write access to financial systems, and
# never grant anything that can move money.
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_ID=
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=
